  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As Heartland Equality has created an entirely new division with Allies in Action dedicated to helping those in Kentucky, Illinois, Missouri, and Tennessee in times of disaster (as seen in the December 10th Storms that ravaged Western Kentucky &amp; Tennessee, and the historic flooding and devastation in Eastern Kentucky).  Heartland Equality has donated more than 18 truckloads worth of goods from food to blankets and housing supplies to both immediate and long-term recovery.  A truck is in dire need</narrative>
  </description>
